The Board of Selection meeting for Monday, 04/12/2021

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:05.520
to

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.440
order at 07:00.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.360
The first thing we're going to do is pledge allegiance.

00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:14.335
I pledge allegiance

00:00:15.135 --> 00:00:15.935
>> the flag of

00:00:16.735 --> 00:00:18.655
The United States Of America

00:00:19.215 --> 00:00:20.575
and to republics

00:00:20.815 --> 00:00:22.495
for which it stands,

00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:23.455
>> nation

00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:25.695
under God,

00:00:26.415 --> 00:00:26.975
indivisible,

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:28.690
with liberty,

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.530
and justice for all.

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.570
>> Okay, we're going to move on to, public speak.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:44.575
First to speak is Shannon Lautumn. Shannon?

00:00:52.895 --> 00:00:55.060
>> Thank you for allowing me to speak first. First.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.020
I would like to publicly apologize

00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:59.380
for my inappropriate

00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:00.660
and disrespectful

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.300
words

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:03.700
that were unintentionally captured

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:08.820
while Mr. Murray was speaking at last Wednesday's Board of Finance budget workshop.

00:01:10.265 --> 00:01:12.825
I never would have said those words publicly.

00:01:13.225 --> 00:01:15.305
And in case it wasn't obvious,

00:01:16.585 --> 00:01:26.230
I had no way of knowing that I was not muted when I said them because I was on my phone in a car and not able to know that I was not muted.

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:29.670
I have apologized to Chairman Brinker

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:31.510
and now am apologizing

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:33.030
to Selectman Murray.

00:01:34.150 --> 00:01:36.470
I have heard that there is a misunderstanding

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:41.645
about my efforts to try to get the board clerk, Amanda Gibson, to delete my comment.

00:01:42.205 --> 00:01:43.565
That is not true.

00:01:44.605 --> 00:01:47.565
Knowing that the meeting was probably being recorded

00:01:47.725 --> 00:01:49.485
and might be publicly posted,

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.930
I asked that Ms. Gibson look into bleeping my swears

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.930
because I was concerned

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.770
that publicly broadcasting

00:01:57.770 --> 00:02:00.010
a video with obscenities

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.570
might be an FCC violation

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:04.730
and subject the town to fines.

00:02:05.885 --> 00:02:10.845
I took responsibility to Chairman Brinker and Ms. Gibson for my words,

00:02:11.325 --> 00:02:13.725
which if we were not in the time of Zoom,

00:02:13.965 --> 00:02:16.765
would not have been reflected in the meeting minutes.

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:21.180
I have reflected quite a lot on what occurred

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.500
and want everyone to know the following.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:27.420
I should have contacted Selectman Murray privately

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.100
to express my upset

00:02:29.785 --> 00:02:30.825
about how

00:02:31.225 --> 00:02:33.145
he has publicly denigrated

00:02:33.145 --> 00:02:34.745
the Board of Education,

00:02:35.065 --> 00:02:36.825
and by extension me

00:02:36.825 --> 00:02:38.345
as its chairwoman

00:02:38.505 --> 00:02:40.105
for what he believes

00:02:40.105 --> 00:02:43.785
is how the Board of Ed has not done its job properly for six years,

00:02:44.570 --> 00:02:47.610
which is the time during which I have been the board chair.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:54.170
I have no issue with Selectman Murray's disagreeing with the Board of Education budget.

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:57.050
My issue was with his consistent

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:58.330
public attacks

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.365
on our process and job performance,

00:03:01.685 --> 00:03:02.725
and including

00:03:02.805 --> 00:03:05.045
attacks on the superintendent,

00:03:05.205 --> 00:03:07.685
who has only been at her job for nine months.

00:03:08.885 --> 00:03:13.205
I have only one time in almost six years as an elected official

00:03:13.365 --> 00:03:15.285
ever publicly commented

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:19.220
about any other Andover board or board member,

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:25.300
and that was because I believed that selectmen were disrespectful to Superintendent Bruno.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:30.580
During at least three recent Board of Education public meetings,

00:03:31.365 --> 00:03:33.925
I have called for the public disrespect

00:03:34.165 --> 00:03:36.725
among Andover's three primary

00:03:37.045 --> 00:03:38.325
co equal

00:03:38.325 --> 00:03:39.045
boards,

00:03:39.685 --> 00:03:41.365
the boards of Selectmen,

00:03:41.445 --> 00:03:42.645
Finance, and Education,

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:45.490
to stop the disrespectful

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.850
public attacks,

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:48.290
and it is not.

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:53.330
And I certainly didn't aid in that endeavor last Wednesday,

00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:55.490
for which I am now apologizing.

00:03:57.005 --> 00:03:57.805
Finally,

00:03:58.845 --> 00:04:03.245
First Electman Maguire informed me at about 05:30 this evening

00:04:03.565 --> 00:04:07.725
that he intends to entertain an agenda item to discuss me.

00:04:08.525 --> 00:04:12.600
So I am formally noting my objection to such

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.040
on two grounds.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.880
Number one,

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:19.640
one point five hours of notice is insufficient

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:23.720
in case I wanted to have legal counsel attend the meeting,

00:04:24.645 --> 00:04:29.365
whether or not it was to occur publicly or in executive session.

00:04:29.845 --> 00:04:33.685
One point five hours does not meet the legal criteria

00:04:33.685 --> 00:04:38.565
to discuss an individual and add an agenda item about that individual.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.670
Number two,

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:43.950
the Board of Selectmen has absolutely

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.750
no legal authority over me,

00:04:47.230 --> 00:04:49.790
and therefore has no jurisdiction

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:50.910
whatsoever

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:51.870
to discuss me.

00:04:53.355 --> 00:04:57.435
I clearly have no control over what is said in public comment,

00:04:57.835 --> 00:04:59.755
and I will listen respectfully

00:04:59.915 --> 00:05:01.355
to all that is said.

00:05:02.235 --> 00:05:04.155
But I respectfully suggest

00:05:04.235 --> 00:05:08.090
that specifically adding an agenda item to discuss

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:09.930
another elected official

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.410
over whom the Board of Selectmen

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:14.330
has no legal authority

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.010
is improper.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:22.250
I also finally want to note that I was solely speaking as a private citizen

00:05:22.715 --> 00:05:23.595
in my

00:05:23.915 --> 00:05:25.595
unintended utterance

00:05:25.835 --> 00:05:28.955
that occurred in public comment last Wednesday,

00:05:29.595 --> 00:05:33.995
and I clearly was not speaking in my capacity as Board of Ed Chair.

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.980
I therefore have no

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.780
reason to be discussed

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:44.900
in that I was not acting in my legal or public elected official capacity.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:47.460
Thank you for allowing me to speak.

00:05:48.215 --> 00:05:51.175
I apologize to Selectman Murray for my words,

00:05:51.575 --> 00:05:53.975
and I look forward to hearing your comments

00:05:54.135 --> 00:05:56.695
during public comment only.

00:05:57.015 --> 00:05:57.415
Thank you.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:01.410
>> Thank you, Shannon.

