00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:36.020
I truly do.

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:38.500
First off,

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:44.020
I don't want this innocent. I do not want this incident to become political.

00:11:44.905 --> 00:11:51.465
Many times when they do, it reflects poorly on our town and it undermines everything positive

00:11:51.545 --> 00:11:53.145
we are trying to accomplish.

00:11:53.545 --> 00:11:57.625
Like the work at the Veterans Monument Park and the plans for the community center.

00:11:58.105 --> 00:11:59.865
The bickering editorials

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:01.790
and articles in the River East

00:12:02.190 --> 00:12:04.910
against one another really needs to stop.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:11.390
And people really need to consider the damage done to the town when they get engaged in such behavior.

00:12:12.675 --> 00:12:14.355
It accomplishes nothing

00:12:14.595 --> 00:12:16.195
but to foster hate

00:12:16.355 --> 00:12:18.515
and division between all of us.

00:12:19.795 --> 00:12:22.675
In regard to what was said Wednesday night,

00:12:23.715 --> 00:12:26.755
I was probably just as shocked and stunned as everyone else who heard it.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.890
It was derogatory,

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:30.410
inflammatory,

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.410
and it was completely out of line.

00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.090
Unfortunately,

00:12:34.090 --> 00:12:37.530
things said in a public forum are captured in recordings

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.530
and they are not easily retracted.

00:12:41.025 --> 00:12:42.305
Without exception,

00:12:42.705 --> 00:12:45.025
we must all take personal responsibility

00:12:45.425 --> 00:12:47.745
for our actions and what we say.

00:12:48.625 --> 00:12:53.265
I think everyone would agree the proper thing that should have been done after this incident

00:12:53.390 --> 00:12:54.590
was for Shannon

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:59.150
to immediately reach out to me with an apology for what was said.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.150
But unfortunately,

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:02.350
that didn't occur.

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:08.575
Instead, she decided to call the town hall attempting to conceal or erase

00:13:08.735 --> 00:13:10.015
what she had said

00:13:10.655 --> 00:13:14.895
of issuing instead of issuing a personal apology to me.

00:13:16.015 --> 00:13:19.455
Even though what she said on Wednesday night really bothered me,

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:25.690
the attempt to censor or cover up what she said to me was even more insulting.

00:13:26.490 --> 00:13:31.130
That action set a clear message to me that she was not remorseful

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:34.585
for her remarks and had no respect for me whatsoever.

00:13:35.145 --> 00:13:36.745
It made a bad situation

00:13:36.745 --> 00:13:37.785
much worse.

00:13:39.465 --> 00:13:42.345
As members of the town who hold elective office,

00:13:42.665 --> 00:13:45.625
we must all be careful to hold ourselves to a higher standard

00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:48.810
and respect each other and the public at large.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:50.250
However,

00:13:50.490 --> 00:13:52.010
the comments made Wednesday

00:13:52.170 --> 00:13:54.330
were vile and disgusting.

00:13:54.970 --> 00:13:58.250
It was very troubling that the chair of the Andover Board of Education

00:13:58.695 --> 00:14:00.375
could not control herself

00:14:00.455 --> 00:14:04.935
and let her emotions run, which resulted in those hurtful words directed at me.

00:14:05.815 --> 00:14:09.415
Because of her comments and subsequent actions to conceal what she said,

00:14:09.735 --> 00:14:13.895
Shannon Loudon has lost my respect and the respect of many parents,

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:17.120
board members and residents of Andover.

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:25.760
I feel you cannot be a respected leader anymore after the words and subsequent actions to censor what you said following this incident.

00:14:26.495 --> 00:14:28.815
What you did was inexcusable.

00:14:29.135 --> 00:14:30.815
You should have known better.

00:14:31.215 --> 00:14:32.015
I

00:14:32.975 --> 00:14:36.815
feel it would be in the best interest of the town if you voluntarily

00:14:36.815 --> 00:14:42.480
stepped down and resigned from your leadership position as the chair from the Andover Board of Education.

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:50.480
I'm asking you to please stop for a moment and consider putting both the Andover Elementary Schools and town's reputation

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:51.840
before yours

00:14:52.015 --> 00:14:53.615
and spare the townspeople

00:14:53.615 --> 00:14:55.935
any more subsequent negative press

00:14:56.015 --> 00:14:59.215
and embarrassment as a result of your recent actions.

00:14:59.455 --> 00:14:59.855
